[00:38.98] Kris Kraft
[00:39.22] I miss my trusty Kris Kraft
[00:41.48] That itsy bitsy skiff
[00:44.36] With topsiders and chinos
[00:44.78] Freshly pressed and stiff
[00:44.78] And sometimes when I'm landlocked
[00:46.70] And yearning for the sea
[00:49.64] I get into my bathtub
[00:53.14] Indulge my reverie
